      "name": "Design notes",
      "width": 640,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "Build Catalog — HUD / mission board. Desktop 1440×1024 first. Hierarchy: player → catalog → live demos. No cards in hero. Accent #3dff9a unlocked, gold legendary, cyan HUD labels.\n\nPLAYER TABLET (07/07b/07c): fixed col avatar+LOADOUT tiers CORE/STRONG/FAMILIAR; vertical tabs ORIGINS/CLEARS/TROPHIES beside avatar; motion later: tab fade 120–200ms, skill fill stagger 40–60ms, soft tablet idle."
